          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Star brite Premium Golden Teak Oil</strong> is the best all-round teak oil and the one to buy if colour is the priority. Indoors, <strong class="text-white">Watco</strong> gives the classic hand-rubbed finish that suits furniture perfectly, and on a boat, <strong class="text-white">TotalBoat's</strong> mildew inhibitors earn their premium.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
